<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span data-teams="true" style=""><span data-teams="true" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" size="2">Dear {!DirectDebitRequest__c.CustomerAccountName__c},</font></span><div style=""><span data-teams="true"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></span></div><div style=""><span data-teams="true" style=""><span data-teams="true" style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Greetings from Modon.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p style="">

</p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">We are pleased to confirm that your <b>Direct Debit Mandate
has been successfully activated</b>.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><strong>Direct Debit Reference:</strong> {!DirectDebitRequest__c.DDA_Reference_Number__c}</font></p><p style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><b><span style="line-height: 115%;">Mandate
Status:</span></b><span style="line-height: 115%;">
Active</span></font></p><p style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><span style="line-height: 115%;"><b><span style="line-height: 115%;">Activation
Date:</span></b><span style="line-height: 115%;">&nbsp;</span></span>{!DirectDebitRequest__c.Bank_Approved_Date__c}<br></font></p><p style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Your mandate is now active for processing applicable
payments in accordance with your agreed payment schedule and mandate terms.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">No further action is required from you at this stage.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Thank you for choosing Modon.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></p>

